cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or the data it reconciles, please cite the
  accompanying paper.
title: >-
  Bayesian material flow analysis of the U.S. aluminum cycle (2017, 2022)
abstract: >-
  Reproducible code and data for a Bayesian material flow analysis of the
  United States aluminum cycle, reconciling a 234-flow network against
  multi-source observations under mass-balance and bound constraints and
  reporting a credible interval for every flow.
type: software
